### SATYA – AI Evidence Integrity System

SATYA is an AI-powered web platform designed to support the **verification, analysis, and integrity of digital evidence**. The system focuses on helping users assess evidence more efficiently by combining modern web technologies with AI-driven analysis.

The project is developed as a responsive web application with a structured frontend architecture, providing a foundation for building an accessible and user-friendly evidence integrity system. SATYA aims to improve trust in digital information by supporting evidence assessment, authenticity analysis, and organized presentation of results.

**Key Focus Areas:**

* AI-assisted evidence analysis
* Digital evidence integrity and verification
* User-friendly and responsive web interface
* Structured presentation of evidence and analysis
* Modern web development architecture
* Technology-driven approach to improving trust in digital information

**Project Goal:**
To develop a reliable and intelligent platform that can assist users in evaluating digital evidence and making better-informed decisions based on evidence integrity.
